  "content": "<h1>EMI 礦物資訊</h1><p>直接在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 內輕鬆查看礦物生成資訊。</p><p>EMI Ores 是配方檢視器 EMI 的外掛程式，可顯示世界中礦物的生成資訊，包括：</p><ul>\n<li>Y軸高度分布</li>\n<li>礦脈尺寸</li>\n<li>每區塊礦脈數量</li>\n<li>生態域限制</li>\n</ul><p>此模組需同時安裝在客戶端與伺服器端才能正常運作；若僅單邊安裝會自動停用功能。</p><p>由於本模組直接從資料包設定的特徵配置獲取數據，絕大多數情況下模組新增的礦物無需額外設定即可正確顯示。</p><h2>預覽畫面</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sG4TqDb8/images/3750923965bda8eacaf0978e137149bdcc8c073b.png\" alt=\"鑽石礦\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sG4TqDb8/images/05ccbda2b7af3a1b3b562b62b37447dd39b13903.png\" alt=\"綠寶石礦\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sG4TqDb8/images/5e42667c84c82862abcd01f110dafdfb253f2fa3.png\" alt=\"遠古殘骸\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sG4TqDb8/images/3f6c855c56c87d6490820588b2b279a5bac71a20.png\" alt=\"紫水晶洞\"></p><h2>與現有礦物生成檢視外掛程式比較</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>EMI Ores</th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-resources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Resources</a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示礦物生成資訊</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示非礦物類世界生成資訊</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自動支援模組新增礦物</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示生態域限制</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合併石頭與深板岩礦種</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>數據來源</td>\n<td>資料包特徵配置</td>\n<td>硬編碼</td>\n<td>區塊掃描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配方檢視器支援</td>\n<td>EMI</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>, EMI (透過JEI)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示戰利品表</td>\n<td>❌[^1]</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示村民交易</td>\n<td>❌[^2]</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顯示物品可附魔屬性</td>\n<td>⭕[^3]</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>原生生態域圖示由 Minecraft Wiki 貢獻者依據 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f3.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 3.0</a> 授權，取自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fBiome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生態域維基頁面</a>。</p><p>[^1]: 請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-loot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Loot</a>。\n[^2]: 請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-trades-villager-trading-emi-plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Trades</a>。\n[^3]: EMI 內建基礎功能，另可參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Enchanting</a>。</p>",
